<title>ARGENTINA: Usage of Argentine services rises 12.3 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Usage of Argentine services rises 12.3 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The usage of gas, electricity, water, public transport and telecommunications in Argentina rose 12.3 percent in February against the same period last year, the Economy Ministry said Monday.</p>
<p>The Ministry added in a statement that the usage of these services dropped 7.9 percent in February against January.</p>
<p>Also, that during January and February 1997 the usage of the services rose 13.3 percent over the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>The figures were released by Argentina's National Institute of Statistics.</p>
<p>((-- Daniel Helft, Buenos Aires Newsroom + 541 318 0663))</p>
